    kind: work_item  # 5a68
    title: "c/cpp: a function definition whose name comes from an unexpandable macro (TEST_BEGIN(x) {..}, PFX(x)(args), export-macro class misparse) gets no symbol; its calls stay unemitted -- redis 2598+210+15 sites, tmate 26, sherpa-onnx 3"  # 5a68
    status: todo_hard  # 5a68
    priority: 3  # 5a68
    parent:  # 5a68
    tags:  # 5a68
    - c  # 5a68
