  message: "Merged in PR #1459 (dev ecbb226a0d).\n\nFixed in PR #1459 (80ecd183ca, c7c31f7676), by the rule the owner set: no invented name. Every edge drawn from inside a definition whose name comes from an unexpandable macro comes from the nearest enclosing record with a symbol (an outer definition, else the file) and carries meta.src_stands_in_for=\"unnamed_definition\". Behavioral evidence: test_c_call_anchor::test_a_call_in_an_unnamed_definition_stands_in (TEST_BEGIN body: calls/&f/callback edges from the file, marked; a macro-named definition inside a named one: from the outer, marked; plain calls unmarked), plus the cpp misparse/PFX tests. redis: 2,816 of 2,823 call sites recovered (2,985 calls + 54 references, marked); tmate 26/26; x265 1/1 (real). NOT done: the export-macro class misparse (filed as WI-divus-garom-zojav-golog-sidod-hibit-kavit-tozij; its 3 stand-in edges on sherpa-onnx are parse artifacts), and the dispatch-table variable's dangling src the new gate found (WI-dirij-norod-pugup-sasoh-satab-lubut-tahap-jupuz)."  # bd78
